{"rendered":
 "```lean\ncase grind\nl : List Nat\nr : Nat\nh : sumDef l = r\n⊢ wp\n    (have acc := 0;\n    do\n    let __s ←\n      forIn l acc fun x __s =>\n          have acc := __s;\n          have acc := acc + x;\n          pure (ForInStep.yield acc)\n    have acc : Nat := __s\n    pure acc)\n    (fun r => r = l.sum) PUnit.unit\n```",
 "goals":
 ["case grind\nl : List Nat\nr : Nat\nh : sumDef l = r\n⊢ wp\n    (have acc := 0;\n    do\n    let __s ←\n      forIn l acc fun x __s =>\n          have acc := __s;\n          have acc := acc + x;\n          pure (ForInStep.yield acc)\n    have acc : Nat := __s\n    pure acc)\n    (fun r => r = l.sum) PUnit.unit"]}
{"textDocument": {"uri": "file:///vcgenInfoTree.lean"},
 "position": {"line": 22, "character": 3}}
{"rendered":
 "```lean\ncase vc1\nl : List Nat\nr : Nat\nh : sumDef l = r\n⊢ 0 + l.sum = l.sum\n```\n---\n```lean\ncase vc2\nl : List Nat\nr : Nat\nh : sumDef l = r\na✝¹ : Nat\na✝ : a✝¹ + [].sum = l.sum\n⊢ a✝¹ = l.sum\n```\n---\n```lean\ncase vc3\nl : List Nat\nr : Nat\nh : sumDef l = r\npref✝ : List Nat\ncur✝ : Nat\nsuff✝ : List Nat\n_h✝ : l = pref✝ ++ cur✝ :: suff✝\nb✝ : Nat\na✝ : b✝ + (cur✝ :: suff✝).sum = l.sum\nacc : Nat := b✝ + cur✝\n⊢ acc + suff✝.sum = l.sum\n```",
 "goals":
 ["case vc1\nl : List Nat\nr : Nat\nh : sumDef l = r\n⊢ 0 + l.sum = l.sum",
  "case vc2\nl : List Nat\nr : Nat\nh : sumDef l = r\na✝¹ : Nat\na✝ : a✝¹ + [].sum = l.sum\n⊢ a✝¹ = l.sum",
  "case vc3\nl : List Nat\nr : Nat\nh : sumDef l = r\npref✝ : List Nat\ncur✝ : Nat\nsuff✝ : List Nat\n_h✝ : l = pref✝ ++ cur✝ :: suff✝\nb✝ : Nat\na✝ : b✝ + (cur✝ :: suff✝).sum = l.sum\nacc : Nat := b✝ + cur✝\n⊢ acc + suff✝.sum = l.sum"]}
